      "content": "idk the antibiotic stuff is kinda expensive at the pharmacy... my grandma always says that putting a thick layer of Vaseline or even some vegetable oil on a burn helps it heal way faster because it seals everything in. wouldn't that be better than just a bandage? it feels so tight and dry now, i just want to slather it in something to make the stinging stop.",
